A few issues:
- `state.activeCharacter` not defined. We'll set in setActiveCharacter or use characters[state.gender]. In updateCharacter, setMouth uses state.activeCharacter. We'll set.
- `action = active ? state.action : 'listen'` when input focused; but state.action becomes 'talk' when say; active false if input is focused, so character listens rather than gestures. Fine, but talking mouth is independent. Could not gate action by input; maybe keep. Actually when the user focuses input while companion is talking, action becomes listen, okay. But `active` includes any input focus; good.
- `state.blinkStart`, state.blinkAt are in state as `blinkAt: performance.now()+2600, blinkStart:-1`; good.
- `controller.phase` not set. Need add in buildVRM or update; otherwise t = NaN. Add `controller.phase = Math.random() * 8;` in build or in update guard. We'll add in build. Also `state.activeCharacter`. Edit buildVRM controller object.

- `setMouth` calls state.activeCharacter expressions, while updateCharacter already has expressions. Could pass controller. Simpler modify setMouth signature to accept expr; but currently uses active char. Ensure state.activeCharacter is the current. For hidden char not updated. Fine. At build, active maybe null; setMouth not called before start because updateCharacter would return? It checks controller.root.visible; girlRoot visible true initially but avatar hidden; root visible? girlRoot.visible default true, boyRoot false. `updateCharacter` in loop will see controller.root.visible true even if avatar parent hidden! We need check `avatar.visible` at top. Add `if (!controller || !avatar.visible || !controller.root.visible)`. Since only active root visible. Also state.activeCharacter set on start. Good.

- `state.action` initial 'idle'. Good.
- When action 'hug' ends after duration, state.action changes in loop (need implement). Currently updateCharacter uses state.action, but state.action never resets after actionUntil except startAction sets `actionUntil`; nothing sets it back. We need in main loop or updateCharacter:
```
if (state.action !== 'idle' && performance.now() > state.actionUntil) state.action='idle';
```
But if talk action from say ends, idle. Add at start of animate or in updateCharacter. We'll do in animate.

- `setMouth` resets all vowels every frame then sets one. Fine.
- `aimBone` only updates rotation, not position; good.
- `rest` is captured after arms down but before `vrm.update(.016)`? We set rest before vrm.update. Good.
- `controller.phase` add.
- `action='listen'` while input focused: `state.action` maybe talk, but action var listen. That means if user input is focused and the character reply is delivered? sendMessage clears input then focus stays, so state.active listening but talking mouth. The gesture would be listen; fine.
- Face expressions using regex on mood; mood strings have "тёплая нежность" triggers happy; okay.

Potential issue: The `head` normalized bone rotation y is applied, but since model root has rotation π, headY sign maybe opposite; small.
- Eye look at camera. Good.

Now load/start/loop/events.

